# WP-MAP-VIEW (UE UWorldPartitionMiniMapBuilder + AWorldPartitionMiniMap; SWorldPartitionEditorGrid2D: the minimap
# under the grid, ShowActors / DrawActorLabels): the World Partition map draws the world seen from above (Build
# Minimap: an orthographic BaseColor capture of the world, tile by tile with the tile's region loaded, written to
# <stem>_MiniMap.detex and referenced with its world bounds from the WorldPartition block), the cell grid over it,
# the footprints and names of the entities the editor holds once the view is close enough, and an outline on every
# cell whose HLOD is built - a separate, bolder colour where the HLOD is stale against the saved world.
# Stale is judged against the SAVED world (WorldCells::StaleHLODCells, as Build HLODs and the cook judge it): hence
# Save, then the panel's Refresh, after the bench edit.
# Lead: the zoom over the panel and the bench's id are the two lines to check against DesertCtl's forms (marked).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
# The map is the canvas under the panel's sections: the panel is maximized so the frame shows it whole.
Дано run Panel "Maximize panel: World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Дано run Scene "Build Minimap"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Refresh"
Тогда map_minimap панель World Partition: под сеткой ячеек - вид мира сверху (ландшафт, дороги, дома), сетка ячеек и цвета состояний поверх; у ячеек с HLOD голубая внутренняя рамка, в легенде строки "HLOD built (N)" и "HLOD stale (Build HLODs again) (0)"
# Lead: the zoom form over the map (wheel over the panel's canvas), ~10 notches towards the loaded area at the origin.
Когда input scroll "World Partition" 1000,1050 10
Тогда map_zoomed тот же вид ближе: белые прямоугольники отпечатков загруженных сущностей с именами внутри тех, где имя помещается
# The house nearest the origin, Main C08_08_B00 (200408): any change of its mesh record makes its cell's HLOD stale.
Когда select 200408
Когда --subject selection set Scale 1,1.5,1
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Refresh"
Тогда map_footprints_stale прямоугольники и имена сущностей; ячейка скамейки обведена толстой пурпурной рамкой (HLOD stale), в легенде "HLOD stale (Build HLODs again) (1)"
